                VtsHalWifiV1_3TargetTest \
                VtsHalWifiApV1_4TargetTest VtsHalWifiNanV1_4TargetTest VtsHalWifiRttV1_4TargetTest
    Change-Id: Ibdff93ea56aff186d4b5361ac77f6f448a0dfd45

