     - BAD_HANDLE is renamed to BAD_BUFFER
     - GRALLOC1_CONSUMER_USAGE_FOREIGN_BUFFERS is removed
     - CPU_{READ,WRITE}_OFTEN no longer implies CPU_{READ,WRITE}
    
